    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-1" id="fn-1" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="color:#000000;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Moved outstanding checks issued to vendors from Cash line to Accounts Payable account number 232 for both 2024 and 2025.</span>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-2" id="fn-2" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Note Liberty Utilities (Rio Rico Water &amp; Sewer) Corp(Name changed to Liberty Utilities (AZ Consolidated) Corp in 12/2025. Combined Liberty Utilies (Beradsley Water) Corp, Liberty Utilities(cordes Lakes Water) Corp and Liberty Utilities (Bella Vista Water) Corp . Combined amounts for both 2025 and 2024.</link:footnote>
